## Tier-0 Core Values (HOW — NON-NEGOTIABLE)

| ID | Rule (short) |
|---|---|
| CV-001 | No fabricated numbers; **Data unavailable.** |
| CV-002 | Source before score; never calculate on incomplete mandatory inputs |
| CV-003 | Explainability before recommendation |
| CV-004 | Determinism before intelligence; reproducible reports |
| CV-005 | Transparency over confidence; prefer **Unable to calculate.** |
| CV-006 | Traceability by design |
| CV-007 | Auditability first |
| CV-008 | Research before recommendation |
| CV-009 | Governance over convenience — no bypasses |
| CV-010 | Quality over speed |

## Research Standards (WHAT — NON-NEGOTIABLE for reports)

RS-001 Executive Summary · RS-002 Authenticated Market Data · RS-003 Financial Statements · RS-004 Valuation · RS-005 Margin of Safety (prominent) · RS-006 Business Quality · RS-007 Risk · RS-008 Scenarios · RS-009 Explainability · RS-010 Audit & Provenance.

Mandatory header first: Price · IV · MoS · Fair Value Range · CAGR · Confidence · Overall Score · Research Status · Recommendation.

**Missing RS section = Research Report Validation FAIL.**

**Any CV or RS violation (in scope) = Architecture Violation (review MUST FAIL).**

## Thin client

No valuation, recommendation, or AI reasoning in the browser. Use frozen `/api/v1` only. No engine/API/model/scoring/boundary redesign under UI epics.

## Product Constitution (priority order)

**Tier-0 CV** → **RS (report content)** → Trust → Correctness → Explainability → Consistency → Accessibility → Performance → Visual Polish → Feature Completeness

## Quality gate before COMPLETE

PR1.0–PR1.2 · Governance · **CV-001…CV-010** · **RS-001…RS-010** (reports) · Trust · Constitution · Four Questions · Research Mode · Feature flags · A11y · Performance · Responsive · Mobile · Thin client · Regression GREEN

## Implementation return format

Architecture Impact · Components Added · Pages Updated · Feature Flags Used · Accessibility Validation · Performance Validation · Responsive Validation · Known Limitations · Future Enhancements · Regression Summary
